    website: "https://harjot.co"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HarjjotSinghh/reinstate"
url: "https://github.com/HarjjotSinghh/reinstate"
abstract: >-
  Reinstate is a local-first CLI that syncs AI coding agent sessions across
  devices with end-to-end encryption and bring-your-own R2/S3-compatible
  storage. Phase 1 targets Claude Code and OpenAI Codex same-vendor resume
  with cross-OS path remapping. Credentials are never synced.
keywords:
  - ai-coding-agents
  - session-sync
  - claude-code
  - codex
  - encryption
  - developer-tools
